Rationale: semantic tokens separate design intent from values, enabling consistent revision and reuse.
Quality gates: WCAG AA contrast, readable type, scale-based spacing, semantic names, and documented deprecated aliases.
Repository path intent: /projects/project-001/sections/e/token-map.mmd
Writing and publishing rules: use sentence case, concise labels, one action per control, stable token names, and no raw values outside token definitions; publish after contrast and regression checks.